# LLM provider
# FALA_API_KEY — API key for the LLM (overrides OPENAI_API_KEY)
# OPENAI_API_KEY — fallback API key
# FALA_BASE_URL — API base URL (default: https://api.openai.com/v1)
# FALA_MODEL — model name (default: gpt-4o)

# TTS (text-to-speech)
# FALA_TTS — TTS provider (default: openai)
# FALA_TTS_VOICE — TTS voice (default: alloy; pt-PT options: onyx, nova, shimmer)

# STT (speech-to-text)
# FALA_STT_MODEL — local Whisper model size (default: base; requires openai-whisper)
